# ModCheck: the overlay-demo mod's stage name in the pause menu (common.szs /2d/stagename.bmg entry 1, PauseMenu2.cpp:113).
# Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE=1. Install: python tools/mod_pack.py --out build/Strict/mods/overlay-demo
# plus mods-example/overlay-demo/mod.json there. Evidence: [mods] overlay in use: ...common.szs, pause.png shows the stage name.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=60
log
hold START frames=3
wait frames=120
log
shot pause.png
wait frames=30
end
